  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Counter Trafficking in Crisis Contexts Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to expand the knowledge and institutionalization of counter-trafficking activities within the broader humanitarian coordination system. To achieve this goal, activities will continue to target direct field operations such as the continued co-leadership of the Global Protection Cluster (GPC) Anti-Trafficking Task Team; longer deployments of anti-trafficking experts to humanitarian settings; internal and external trainings of front-line stakeholders, and the establishment of a resource hub and moderated stakeholder discussion forum.</narrative>
  </description>
